  "description": "Get set to get mountain biking\nHowever you ride, Whyte Secta R is ready to help you ride your best – right from the shop floor. With the same frame as our critically praised Whyte Secta RS, the Whyte Secta R is designed to help unlock your riding in a fun, confidence-inspiring and high-value package. Its fully-featured frame, specially curated components – including a dropper seat post to give you maximum confidence on descents (letting you lower and raise the saddle as your ride at the touch of button) – and enabling handling all combine to deliver you the best mountain bike trail performance and price possible. All so you can have maximum fun on the trail – and more money in your pocket.\n\nHighlights\n– Fully featured 6061 T6 precision formed aluminium frame.\n– 130mm Suntour XCR 34 suspension fork.\n– TransX full-insertion dropper post (with frame size-specific drop).\n– Capable, smooth-rolling 29er wheels + Maxxis tyres.\n– Shimano Cues 1x9 transmission (30T chainring x 11-46 cassette).\n– Tektro two-piston hydraulic disc brakes (180mm rotors front + rear).",
